/* The tally's stylesheet -- M61/T61.6 (docs/plan-lss.md).

   Lumen's examples/counter/app.lss, selector for selector where this
   framework can say the same thing, and saying why where it cannot:

   - The token names differ. Lumen's `page`, `surface`, `muted` and
     `accent` are palette ROLES here (`$page` follows `app.setPalette`),
     and a token may not shadow a role -- it would silently stop following
     the palette. The tally keeps fixed colours, so its tokens are renamed.
   - The accent is two steps darker than Lumen's #4d7cfe: white on that is
     3.7:1, under WCAG AA's 4.5:1 for 16 px text; this is 5.0:1
     (`scripts/ui_check.py contrast`).
   - There are no run-time classes, so Lumen's `.value.pos` / `.pill.pos`
     are `@sheet pos` blocks, one per sign, which `Program::style_lss_by`
     swaps when the count's sign changes (src/app.rs).
   - Lumen's layout lives in Rust there and in the sheet here: width,
     padding, alignment and the type scale are declarations. */

// ANCHOR: base
@tokens {
    ground: #0e1118ff;   /* Lumen's `page` */
    panel: #161c28ff;    /* Lumen's `surface` */
    ink: #f1f5fbff;
    faint: #8b94a7ff;    /* Lumen's `muted` */
    action: #3563efff;   /* Lumen's `accent`, darkened (above) */
    ghost: #232c3eff;
    pos: #34d399ff;
    neg: #fb7185ff;
    zero: #9aa3b6ff;
    white: #ffffffff;
}

#card {
    background: $panel;
    border-radius: 26px;
    padding: 32px;
    width: 360px;
    box-shadow: 18px;
    align: center;
}
#caption { color: $faint; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
#steps { align: center; }
Page { background: $ground; padding: 24px; align: center; }
// ANCHOR_END: base

/* Lumen's `.btn`: 16px, weight 600, 16h/11v padding, 13px radius. */
#reset {
    background: #1b2333ff; color: $faint;
    border-radius: 13px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; padding: 11px 16px;
}
/* The four step buttons: two ghost, two accent. */
#dec10, #dec {
    background: $ghost; color: $ink;
    border-radius: 13px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; padding: 11px 16px;
}
#inc, #inc10 {
    background: $action; color: $white;
    border-radius: 13px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; padding: 11px 16px;
}

/* The hero number and the pill, per sign. */
// ANCHOR: sheet
@sheet pos {
    #value { color: $pos; font-size: 76px; font-weight: 800; }
    #pill {
        background: $pos; color: $ground;
        border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 14px;
    }
}
// ANCHOR_END: sheet
@sheet neg {
    #value { color: $neg; font-size: 76px; font-weight: 800; }
    #pill {
        background: $neg; color: $ground;
        border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 14px;
    }
}
@sheet zero {
    #value { color: $ink; font-size: 76px; font-weight: 800; }
    #pill {
        background: $zero; color: $ground;
        border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 14px;
    }
}
